{"reviews":[{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-polish-0001","row_sha256":"7193b2fbb25fb29c9a016a776519114d8b60291453156b168efe0ba93e4d4045","critique":"The output only capitalizes 'I', 'Tuesday', and sentence starts, and formats '6 pm' as '6 p.m.' That suits the plain, direct profile. All facts and wording are preserved, with nothing added.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-prompt-0016","row_sha256":"874e390f9453ba0e4d6799a63572725e5de96a617457740e9e6d914052f30aa4","critique":"The prompt is well organized and keeps the dates, the 40-minute drive, the lack of evening training staff, the slide kit, the undecided storage and meeting night, and every 'don't assume' constraint. However, it drops the group's stated purpose, 'doing basic creek-water observations.' Only 'three-volunteer group' remains, so the reason for the microscope loan is lost.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"fail","verdict":"fail"},{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-prompt-0010","row_sha256":"48982c04e824c1dfc2927475bd22b09720469cc1e962a1cded785d1fa2275255","critique":"This is an identity row. Checking paragraph by paragraph, including the seven-step numbered list and the quoted question, the output matches the input exactly. The input is already a clean, self-contained prompt.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-prompt-0017","row_sha256":"0c7d725cbf3c4e3b24dbe53ac5cda83256b0a5710dc2a0f9a16a1655b8e1bf0f","critique":"All loom specs are preserved:
- widths 36 and 24 inches;
- eight shafts and two heddles;
- storage depths of 19 and 12 inches;
- prices of $1,180 and $640;
- setup times of 90 and 25 minutes;
- project ranges;
- the manual's 'beginner friendly' note and the tension caveat.
The unconfirmed extra heddle stays hedged, and the five comparison criteria, the lean toward B, the width concern and the final question are all kept. 'How much adjustment they seem to involve' becomes 'the amount of adjustment involved,' which slightly softens the hedge but is not material.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-polish-0002","row_sha256":"d9c86136a4f9a51816bf7e0e04be9baaf94056255392865ea073a4107a549304","critique":"This is an identity row, and the output is byte-identical to the already-polished input, including the curly apostrophe.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-polish-0003","row_sha256":"a5c7adf4f51d5d3f988183e79247a9c22ebe09ec59a06a6f6963c8919a1cffb8","critique":"The output capitalizes the names and the day, changes 'and i met' to 'where I met', and fixes 'more neat' to 'neater'. Leah, the harbor layout, the signal box kit, Birch Lane, and leaving early because of the crowd are all preserved.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-polish-0005","row_sha256":"4be75086fc326d0ae82a15edab487bb568f1d8627467ebf4c4eff4369d33bfd0","critique":"The edits are light: 'like i asked' becomes 'as I asked', 'about what i ordered' becomes 'about right for what I ordered', and the clause about narrowing the delivery window is reordered. The hedges ('mostly dry', 'a few pieces', 'seemed') and the willingness to use the company again are preserved.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3b-dev-polish-0004","row_sha256":"d6539d0436766a25ccfebeff081bfa90ba91e683a8ceb04c7328ff7c6ea75882","critique":"The capitalization and the subjunctive 'seien' are good, and 'beeindruckte mich mehr' keeps the meaning. However, 'ich bin mit einem ruhigeren Kopf gegangen' (I left with a calmer mind) becomes 'ging mit einem ruhigeren Kopf nach Hause' (went home with a calmer mind). The input never says the speaker went home, so 'nach Hause' adds a destination.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"fail","verdict":"fail"}]}
